# Test MakeNamedMaterial / NamedMaterial workflow
LookAt 0 -4 2   0 0 0.5   0 0 1
Camera "perspective" "float fov" 45
Film "rgb" "integer xresolution" 256 "integer yresolution" 256
Integrator "volpath" "integer maxdepth" 5

WorldBegin

LightSource "point" "rgb I" [50 50 50] "point3 from" [3 -2 5]

# Define named materials
MakeNamedMaterial "red_diffuse" "string type" "diffuse"
    "rgb reflectance" [0.8 0.1 0.1]

MakeNamedMaterial "blue_plastic" "string type" "coateddiffuse"
    "rgb reflectance" [0.1 0.2 0.8]
    "float roughness" 0.05
    "float eta" 1.5

MakeNamedMaterial "gold" "string type" "conductor"
    "spectrum eta" "metal-Au-eta"
    "spectrum k" "metal-Au-k"
    "float roughness" 0.02

# Ground
Material "diffuse" "rgb reflectance" [0.4 0.4 0.4]
Shape "disk" "float radius" 5

# Use named materials
AttributeBegin
    Translate -0.8 0 0.4
    NamedMaterial "red_diffuse"
    Shape "sphere" "float radius" 0.4
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
    Translate 0 0 0.4
    NamedMaterial "blue_plastic"
    Shape "sphere" "float radius" 0.4
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
    Translate 0.8 0 0.4
    NamedMaterial "gold"
    Shape "sphere" "float radius" 0.4
AttributeEnd

